            {
              "number": 5,
              "title": "Let owners delegate statement access",
              "body": "Owners want an accountant to read their statements without sharing credentials.\n\nAcceptance:\n\n1. An account owner can grant another user read-only access to that account's statement, and revoke it.\n2. Only the account's owner can grant or revoke; anyone else gets `LedgerError` and nothing changes.\n3. A delegate can view only the accounts that granted them access.\n4. A delegate can never post entries.\n5. Owner, auditor, and teller access is unchanged.\n",
